BIG PICTURE FIRST. the postmortem is a map, not a changelog. lead with
the architecture as it now stands and the one dominant lesson; keep each
finding to the shortest form that still lets a reader act on it. cite the
commit/run as evidence, do not transcribe it. if a detail does not change
what the next person does, cut it.

